1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,250
For adults facing family or relationship pressure: think
privately, then explore relevant lived experience on your terms.

2
00:00:08,484 --> 00:00:12,299
He selects Start privately and begins with his own words.

3
00:00:12,984 --> 00:00:18,099
The first reply follows a prepared local rule, not a connected
model.

4
00:00:22,818 --> 00:00:26,818
It may be wrong. Arjun says Not quite and edits what he means.

5
00:00:27,018 --> 00:00:32,668
He corrects the context: pressure comes from his parents, and he
needs time to think.

6
00:00:33,951 --> 00:00:43,716
Planned Muse Spark could organize a correctable reflection.
Optional Muse voice transcription could turn reviewed speech to
text. Both are disconnected.

7
00:00:50,804 --> 00:00:56,514
Day 4: Ravi names the pull between caring for family and deciding
for himself.

8
00:00:57,804 --> 00:01:01,744
Nisha asks what feels hardest before offering a view.

9
00:01:07,991 --> 00:01:13,796
Day 9: Arjun asked for time. The talk became an argument; he
remains unsure.

10
00:01:14,491 --> 00:01:19,666
A fictional host keeps the thread listening-first and leaves
decisions to Arjun.

11
00:01:24,286 --> 00:01:30,266
A prepared flag opens a human-review example. No real report
reaches a moderator.

12
00:01:35,438 --> 00:01:40,213
Day 16 holds an unanswered question. No response is promised.

13
00:01:53,704 --> 00:01:59,004
Ravi accepts questions in this prepared group only, never in
private messages.

14
00:01:59,204 --> 00:02:06,114
Arjun reviews the exact audience, alias and wording. Consent stays
unchecked; nothing is sent.

15
00:02:09,127 --> 00:02:13,072
No professional provider is verified or bookable here.

16
00:02:13,577 --> 00:02:17,567
Maybe later remains a real option; he can return if he wants.

17
00:02:17,767 --> 00:02:22,147
Arjun can offer one bounded part of his experience, or wait.

18
00:02:23,267 --> 00:02:28,532
His private conversation is excluded; only the reviewed sentence
would appear.

19
00:02:28,767 --> 00:02:34,072
Consent is unchecked, posting is disabled, and the choice remains
his.
